      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORANA MIA (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Jimary January (16.38) in a Grade 5/6. Has the pace to be prominent. Good form should continue. TORI KEEPING (2) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage second, beaten 3.5 lengths (16.13) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 275m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Bold showing expected. WILD MOOD (8) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 6 lengths at this track (16.38). Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Worth following up. DOREEN KEEPING (7) missed the frame latest (16.32) when fourth over 275m at this track in a Grade 4/5. Has four wins already from this draw.",
